 "title": "Ways to raise your children as smarter one.",
 "content": "<h2 style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #ff00fe;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia;\">Ways to raise your children as smarter one!!!</span></span></span></h2><h2><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia;\"></span></span></h2><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia;\">Hi everyone, today in this blog I like to share my thoughts and ideas to raise our children as a smarter and good one.</span></span></p><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia;\">Focus.</span></span></h3><h3><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia;\"></span></span></h3><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia;\">First to teach your children how to be focus while doing a work. <span class=\"hiddenGrammarError\">Today</span>\n most of the youngster and children are addicted to mobile phones and \ntheir attention span is completely destroyed because of it. Teach your \nchildren how to interact with others and insist them not use mobile \nphones at very morning time. Limit your time for using mobile phones.</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"></span></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjwagJp5PVIV2H5mGIhi6b11VB7UQinRtKr541Jgr7VQNOqGCtj_57PYlNSHLfuBOQG7Sp6lHXCoTCCZYBAwGbn-Tv_4v5vBdJccUPEbsOKaMMxU2xl3BpDkUNL9rOTeIhSAnEEK_KH-vzxyxw8Ry7DetlMJDQ0bb6M1SQ_SX8tJpWxp1Jr1EWGER_cmw=s7952\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"5304\" data-original-width=\"7952\" height=\"213\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjwagJp5PVIV2H5mGIhi6b11VB7UQinRtKr541Jgr7VQNOqGCtj_57PYlNSHLfuBOQG7Sp6lHXCoTCCZYBAwGbn-Tv_4v5vBdJccUPEbsOKaMMxU2xl3BpDkUNL9rOTeIhSAnEEK_KH-vzxyxw8Ry7DetlMJDQ0bb6M1SQ_SX8tJpWxp1Jr1EWGER_cmw=s320\" width=\"320\" /></a></span></div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /><span style=\"font-family: georgia;\"><br /></span></span><p></p><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia;\"><span class=\"hiddenGrammarError\">Build</span> self-control.</span></span></h3><h3><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia;\"></span></span></h3><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia;\">Teach\n your children how to be a self-control person. Teach them to how to \nprioritize their needs and how to keep away from the waste of time \nmatters.</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"></span></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhW3qv50bP3WeQKXLdGaqUZn-i8uXHpR8BwIb7ZVyqrvMNc6mnisHmGXhXGp3oatAQ1YPzbRBQXwNKpCJ4pV2XJXPmheYgfJX3o91_J08X2XUs_CJwaVZ2v-s5oLN8xq3cbn2bDdpSnhA2lPcggmH0XfP8lZKI2dARRFgTExOEyOsHQ1TE6ObCp6JsnJw=s5277\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3518\" data-original-width=\"5277\" height=\"213\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhW3qv50bP3WeQKXLdGaqUZn-i8uXHpR8BwIb7ZVyqrvMNc6mnisHmGXhXGp3oatAQ1YPzbRBQXwNKpCJ4pV2XJXPmheYgfJX3o91_J08X2XUs_CJwaVZ2v-s5oLN8xq3cbn2bDdpSnhA2lPcggmH0XfP8lZKI2dARRFgTExOEyOsHQ1TE6ObCp6JsnJw=s320\" width=\"320\" /></a></span></div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span><br /><h4 style=\"text-align: left;\"><i><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: times;\"><i><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #04ff00;\"><span style=\"color: #2b00fe;\"><u><b><span style=\"font-family: times;\">please disable adblocker and allow us to show some advertisements.</span></b></u></span></span></span></i></span></span></i></h4><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia;\"></span></span><p></p><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia;\">Social skills.</span></span></h3><h3><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia;\"></span></span></h3><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia;\">Make your child socializes with others. \nInsist them to play with the other children and try to evade their \ninferiority complex conditions.</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"></span></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgRZLj6Z3ecuEX-fBy3mTJKw1qoEOY1MUsrEd40CxgsFAUjd9P4Epz1OTRT8vEXUEbXIlASTrSOlA-9p3mG-OxTBGtijX8iVXB9MuqD485OGFGAS9C8o6_guSuELaIpYWu-Ijgc6UlrJFqd1Lm3VlAl1zHReplqKyqT0AfpL6Ns8mninBI6IEwokP8iTQ=s3702\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"2459\" data-original-width=\"3702\" height=\"213\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgRZLj6Z3ecuEX-fBy3mTJKw1qoEOY1MUsrEd40CxgsFAUjd9P4Epz1OTRT8vEXUEbXIlASTrSOlA-9p3mG-OxTBGtijX8iVXB9MuqD485OGFGAS9C8o6_guSuELaIpYWu-Ijgc6UlrJFqd1Lm3VlAl1zHReplqKyqT0AfpL6Ns8mninBI6IEwokP8iTQ=s320\" width=\"320\" /></a></span></div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><a href=\"https://randomthoughtsever.blogspot.com/2021/12/the-mental-toughness-guide-how-to.html\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia;\"><b>The Mental Toughness Guide: How to Develop Unbreakable Inner Strength!!!. </b></span></a><span style=\"font-family: georgia;\"><b>🤔</b></span></span><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia;\"></span></span><p></p><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia;\">Accept failures.</span></span></h3><h3><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia;\"></span></span></h3><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia;\">Teach your children how to handle the failures. Teach them failure is a part of life and <span class=\"hiddenGrammarError\">do</span>n’t be afraid of it.</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"></span></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEh4JSPffZgcB0Keho4bPRHdzSVUNFSDkss-raeMYS22DJOxge-gjb71Ong8gHQWnbHomcfm6rmVFt7S7uDjTr4IuMRnmO-Kxj3omir3HrZJ6BxwtsBQq7qANfNRoMjOF3cxzmzAlM-J9xpJd0hG5o418dUzBzFkY67gsJ5bYFKZPNDEVURZfGAddP705A=s4368\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"4368\" data-original-width=\"2912\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEh4JSPffZgcB0Keho4bPRHdzSVUNFSDkss-raeMYS22DJOxge-gjb71Ong8gHQWnbHomcfm6rmVFt7S7uDjTr4IuMRnmO-Kxj3omir3HrZJ6BxwtsBQq7qANfNRoMjOF3cxzmzAlM-J9xpJd0hG5o418dUzBzFkY67gsJ5bYFKZPNDEVURZfGAddP705A=s320\" width=\"213\" /></a></span></div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span><br /><h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: red;\"><u><i><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: times;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><a href=\"https://randomthoughtsever.blogspot.com/2021/07/why-indians-are-too-religious.html\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color: #351c75;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia;\">Religion in India..?🤔click here!!!</span></span></span></a></span></span></span></i></u></span></h3><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia;\"></span></span><p></p><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia;\">Communication skills</span></span></h3><h3><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia;\"></span></span></h3><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia;\">It\n is the most important skill need for the today generation. Teach our \nchildren how to overcome the fear of public speaking and express their \nthoughts with others.</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia;\"></span></span></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhTenZJ9kuc4MjaGtM5kR9Z1IhmZz5NlJWVX3-Pm1y3Mg3BGIqCOBG7mAPCqbtjVsc0PHj2zycGO9FoKFSCI7cOgQkqxjJnLMxdGFGbMaFO3HSBpCxFVztXkO1mAprv-fKrN7x_-_77eTVJcT_nK64b-ELHue_yMnCB5hFFwkpMIGQDpy7wkaPTKIhZKg=s6016\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"4016\" data-original-width=\"6016\" height=\"214\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhTenZJ9kuc4MjaGtM5kR9Z1IhmZz5NlJWVX3-Pm1y3Mg3BGIqCOBG7mAPCqbtjVsc0PHj2zycGO9FoKFSCI7cOgQkqxjJnLMxdGFGbMaFO3HSBpCxFVztXkO1mAprv-fKrN7x_-_77eTVJcT_nK64b-ELHue_yMnCB5hFFwkpMIGQDpy7wkaPTKIhZKg=s320\" width=\"320\" /></a></span></div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br />&nbsp;</span><h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://randomthoughtsever.blogspot.com/p/trending-posts_53.html\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color: #351c75;\"><u><i><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia;\">Trending posts..😲😵click here!!!</span></span></i></u></span></a></h3><p><span style=\"font-family: times;\"><br /></span></p><div><p><span style=\"font-family: times;\"><i><span><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><u><span><i><span style=\"color: red;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span>Thanks for reading this blog,please share with others and help us to grow<span style=\"font-size: medium;\">.</span></span></span></b></span></i></span></u></span></span></i><i><span><span style=\"font-size: med